{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓今（15日）早發生奪命火警，5樓起火單位遍布雜物，一名獨居八旬婦命喪當場。及至傍晚約6時21分，警方再接獲報案指，同邨的龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，約24分鐘後將火撲熄。</p><p>火警中約150人需疏散至安全位置，起火單位姓馮女戶主（92歲）疑感不適需戴上氧氣罩，多名救護員和消防員在旁了解及照顧，事後無須送院。消息指，初步懷疑有人將駁上電源的電飯煲，置於已點火的爐頭上，釀成火警。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，約150人需疏散。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198715026442031104043729.jpeg/Y1Dj7uz7hTCMCcy38JXStu3lF6Fqf6W7YGHu7kVh7u4\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，約150人需疏散。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓發生火警，起火單位女戶主疑感不適需戴上氧氣罩，多名救護員和消防員在旁了解。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198718419575246848976150.jpeg/_lSCuEtHqsizKGjAjaE4ZVxHEwx8WhXfncTKHbjEyh0\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓發生火警，起火單位女戶主疑感不適需戴上氧氣罩，多名救護員和消防員在旁了解。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，有老翁需消防員攙扶。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198715462691590144038796.jpeg/CZy03aPo7U1ZIVHbCbw-fzIZbUSJZmGthvZQgKP2UIA\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，有老翁需消防員攙扶。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓發生火警，起火單位女戶主疑感不適需戴上氧氣罩，多名救護員和消防員在旁了解。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198718488919674880652094.jpeg/g4QE_aLju7lCCkkGA39y0XqtC3l5rxgkBnnuyCN57sg\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓發生火警，起火單位女戶主疑感不適需戴上氧氣罩，多名救護員和消防員在旁了解。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕抵救熄。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198716281226792960368429.jpeg/P_QXGRpY0ftrs4-FZZZocsiouTlC8hjMCfCBSSzwgUk\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕抵救熄。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕抵救熄。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198716284204879872173689.jpeg/mjs3WgevHyeTDwIMU874swC6tE6OyFWQFFX7LzFV-y8\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕抵救熄。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救。（Threads@gord_on1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198714243461943296912643.jpeg/sxHbnEEgaLUZhEcY3g4QORmN3q3jOnmXe4Ja5nuCWuY\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救。（Threads@gord_on1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救。（Threads@gord_on1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198714510186123264349768.png/I9pLG_29vrzrM1eIERnsuEZZS_GXiCPnDrgBDA64AQw\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位失火冒煙，消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救。（Threads@gord_on1111）</figcaption></figure><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓早上奪命火警　80歲獨居婦燒焦</p><p>今早（15日）8時47分，黃大仙下邨龍光樓發生奪命火警，一個5樓單位起火及冒出濃煙，消防員到場開喉將火救熄後，在起火單位內客廳發現一具燒焦女屍。消防處代表交代案情指，80歲死者獨居，單位內有大量雜物，包括尼龍袋、膠袋及膠樽等，又形容雜物堆積高度由1.2米直至天花板。消防處補充，單位內設有神位，亦不排除為火警成因之一，相信火警無可疑，正循煙頭及香燭冥鏹意外燃燒雜物的方向調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，救援人員在單位客廳、距離門口約2米位置發現一具燒焦的女屍（紅點位置）。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198633296435613696298043.jpeg/hEMcT5uYBPTrhh8VGZYBG0FMgaqkI8lUIcvdWwTL3Vs\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，救援人員在單位客廳、距離門口約2米位置發現一具燒焦的女屍（紅點位置）。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198611750300291072642817.jpeg/9Q-9zvM7NSKSCT3MkgYnd9ruRcihV6ZGR0Na52JDWuc\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，消防員射水灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198611747833909248894613.jpeg/YcHUF5yol3kKHyKS8sl3CFd6uXrJD2RRgonJIaeJySE\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，消防員射水灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，仵工於傍晚近6時將死者遺體舁送殮房。（羅日昇攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198700462979682304021439.jpeg/iuS4B5GN5E68pTiIQ1qcienq3qOtPgWP0QS3GPQEtxg\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓奪命火，仵工於傍晚近6時將死者遺體舁送殮房。（羅日昇攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584763535855616985120.jpeg/NebTkxRCG8SBjPdGZmSBEG2R8CFY3p7aRVoY-WBaGPk\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584765964488704647519.jpeg/3bUECLJpg7QrGWcjvLaxEgYeyxPGfYP8ozLBFYYywRU\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584768195989504873526.jpeg/NquZxAQczoqrBpR-P27h6opidOy7iKqW0saFl_fGhZc\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198584770419101696125378.jpeg/Ir7u9r6JamnGnhHOwi74bJ-UM-DfQhzeAZVckSSVXJE\"/><figcaption>現場煙味濃烈，街坊紛紛掩住口鼻。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574259484495872427308.jpeg/26t90eNb6egzo0KPV20hHlfAPPWmJ88wEaWObjSljm4\"/><figcaption>涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574262127038464710845.jpeg/s1SoNvbUjOIeMo4ME-Kdkjf3uBsgSSXGjNpYZKnaWGQ\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574264803135488807436.jpeg/gSrjowDzY2XuyyAkWNYwS4LydZJe4d6FlHeigbF3ooE\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574267575701504439675.jpeg/R1Q4Tpsb_S_nI_DzrQxehtrbSJi6tH4WXdQRJnjUESY\"/><figcaption>警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574258402365440251843.jpeg/mVPNMRO_XcSXx3TX77FmzHEmweGJ5JYJpfKaGYDymhk\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574261212680192072451.jpeg/4msVWr-ANKmlhwfuEn5_NmrsWdPfvO_DVoaGgHOGhoA\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565173401489408403751.jpeg/upmPrJgqsL85VRky7Ni8Xng4cppmF1zEV5aVM1eWlTM\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙從單位湧出。（Alex Ox ChamkinGs/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565176006283264762059.png/Da6P1wRvKKld2LhNqM4VAjmWdi1lHZI5OcBi-znAYvs\"/><figcaption>濃煙從單位湧出。（Alex Ox ChamkinGs/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198565178506219520350146.jpeg/5e4iWEWj-zmaGGoct0Zt6rANh_cTXB8acZcAu3GXALs\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Aaron Ng/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......) 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.428119+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1268,"images":25,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:19:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T18:19:27.824155+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:52.054830+00:00","content_hash":"bcfd63d4c8a4c7d1394c5471af86b5f7e56918f69aa04581153708b78e491253","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}